48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"If we can't borrow against subscriptions, we need a different model.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shion,,The tool inside the bank's cycle never missed a release. That is promising.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
